|passage=I was a bit disappointed. Was that it? No abuse like Lord Byron had endured? Not that I was wishing that upon myself. It was just that a '''blue''' between my parents, albeit a raging, foul, bile-spitting hate fest, was not exactly Charles Dickens.}}
